{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101304","id":2266811230,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HHMte","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101304","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101304.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101304.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101304","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101304/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101304/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101304/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b6cfcdeab50e0f5e3649a328ab39268621635849","number":101304,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `String::ascii` creator functions, to parse a char buffer as ASCII.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The function will log errors if any characters above value 127 are found. This is most similar to `parse_latin1`, but `parse_latin1` will silently and incorrectly parse values above 127 as 'extended latin set' characters, when `ASCII` only is expected. This would be especially incorrect if the input is `utf8`, because the string will silently have incorrect length and misinterpreted characters.\r\n\r\nAs discussed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101293#discussion_r1907518247, two functions in `plist` are known to expect `ASCII`-only strings, so they are used as an excuse to call the new function. It would be correct to call `parse_ascii` on many other occasions (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100641), but I do not have the broad knowledge to search out all these instances. Instead, the function is added here such that future contributions can call it to safely parse `ASCII` when it is expected.\r\n\r\nRequires and includes #101293 (because of implicit conversions).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"htt